---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Terms of Service for The Cayman Journal.",
  canonical_url: "/legal/terms/",
  no_index: true
};
---
<Layout seo={seo} title="Terms of Service | The Cayman Journal">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16 px-6 prose">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Last updated: October 2023</p>

    <h2>1. General Information</h2>
    <p>The content provided on The Cayman Journal is for informational purposes only. It does not constitute legal, financial, or tax advice. While we strive to ensure accuracy, regulations in the Cayman Islands change frequently, and you should always consult with qualified Cayman counsel or financial advisors before making business decisions.</p>

    <h2>2. Use of Tools</h2>
    <p>Our calculators (Salary, Stamp Duty, PR Points) provide estimates based on simplified models of Cayman Islands laws and regulations. They are not official government assessments and should not be relied upon as definitive proof of financial liability or immigration status.</p>

    <h2>3. Copyright</h2>
    <p>All original content, including articles, guides, and tools, is the property of The Cayman Journal and may not be reproduced without explicit permission.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
